# Formatting

This project uses Prettier (`.prettierrc`). Format on save in Cursor/VS Code follows that config via `.vscode/settings.json`.

## Style

- Prefer **single quotes** (`'...'`), not double quotes
- **No semicolons** at the end of statements
- Do not “fix” code by adding `;` or switching to `"`

```ts
// ❌ BAD
import { useAppStore } from "@/stores/app-store";

// ✅ GOOD
import { useAppStore } from '@/stores/app-store'
```

Template literals and JSX attribute quotes are fine when required by syntax.
